---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import ContentSection from "../components/ContentSection.astro";
import FeatureBulletGrid from "../components/FeatureBulletGrid.astro";
import SimpleCTA from "../components/SimpleCTA.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="Restaurant Software Denmark — GastroApp"
  description="Restaurant software for Denmark focused on kitchen operations, inventory control, food waste management, production planning, AI-assisted workflows and team coordination."
  pathname="/restaurant-software-denmark"
>
  <PageHero
    eyebrow="Restaurant Software Denmark"
    title="Restaurant software for modern kitchens in Denmark"
    description="GastroApp is built for restaurants that want stronger operational structure, better visibility, food waste control, AI-assisted workflows and a more professional way to manage kitchen operations."
  />

  <ContentSection
    title="A better way to run restaurant operations in Denmark"
    paragraphs={[
      "Many restaurant teams still rely on spreadsheets, notes, manual stock checks and fragmented communication. That may work for a while, but it creates friction as operations become more demanding.",
      "GastroApp helps restaurants in Denmark centralize recipes, inventory, production planning, events, food waste and team communication inside one structured platform.",
      "The result is not just cleaner software. The result is better operational clarity, more reliable execution and less wasted time across the kitchen workflow."
    ]}
  />

  <FeatureBulletGrid
    title="Why restaurants in Denmark need more structured software"
    items={[
      "Stock visibility helps reduce preventable waste and missed items.",
      "Production planning becomes more reliable when workflows are centralized.",
      "Recipe structure improves consistency across kitchen teams.",
      "Food waste tracking supports more sustainable restaurant operations.",
      "Event preparation becomes easier when all operational details live in one place.",
      "Team communication improves when it is tied to the actual workflow.",
      "Management gets a clearer view of what is planned, pending and completed."
    ]}
  />

  <ContentSection
    title="AI-powered restaurant software for Denmark"
    paragraphs={[
      "GastroApp is not only about organizing workflows. It also introduces AI-assisted features that help restaurants modernize how they operate.",
      "The AI receipt reader and importer helps move supplier receipts and purchase information directly into stock workflows, reducing manual work and making inventory updates faster.",
      "AI learning supports more intelligent system behavior over time, while AI plating design adds creative support for restaurants that want both operational excellence and culinary innovation."
    ]}
  />

  <FeatureBulletGrid
    title="AI features included in GastroApp"
    items={[
      "AI receipt scanner for direct stock-related import workflows.",
      "AI-powered receipt reading to reduce repetitive admin work.",
      "AI learning features that support smarter operations over time.",
      "AI plating design assistant for culinary presentation ideas.",
      "A more modern restaurant software workflow for Denmark.",
      "Operational structure combined with intelligent assistance."
    ]}
  />

  <ContentSection
    title="Food waste control matters in modern restaurant operations"
    paragraphs={[
      "For restaurants in Denmark, food waste is both a cost issue and a sustainability issue. Better visibility over waste helps teams reduce losses and operate more responsibly.",
      "GastroApp includes food waste control as part of a more complete restaurant operations platform, helping teams connect waste to stock, prep and execution.",
      "That makes the software more useful for restaurants that want stronger operational discipline and a more modern way to manage daily workflows."
    ]}
  />

  <ContentSection
    title="Built for operational control, not just admin"
    paragraphs={[
      "GastroApp is not designed as another generic dashboard. It is designed around the practical needs of restaurant teams that need to prep, execute and coordinate under pressure.",
      "For restaurants in Denmark, that means one system where kitchen operations become easier to structure and easier to manage as the business grows.",
      "With GastroApp, that structure is strengthened by food waste control and AI-assisted tools that reduce friction and help restaurants operate with more confidence."
    ]}
  />

  <SimpleCTA
    title="Looking for restaurant software in Denmark?"
    text="GastroApp helps restaurants move from fragmented operations to a cleaner, more structured and more AI-assisted system with stronger food waste visibility."
  />
</MainLayout>